      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b9f6c965a3e1a116727dfa8|full_name}: Even being able to go into an offline mode via the SDK would be nice, not having to wait for the servers to load, how about if we want to test an avatar, take us directly to a avatar testing world instead of having to load into the main game or publish the avatar kind've like how worlds are able to be privately tested.",
